          "quote": "Another approximately 100 g ingot with a nominal composition of AlCoCrFeNi2.1 is also prepared by a vacuum arc-melting furnace. A Ti-getter is used to assimilate the residual oxygen in the chamber. High purity elements (≥99.9%) are arc melted under argon atmosphere for at least five times to ensure chemical homogeneity.",
